{"attack":"模仿对手刚才使出的招式，并使出相同招式。如果对手还没出招则会失败。","description":"使用场上宝可梦最后成功使用的招式。\n在双打对战、三打对战中，如果使出单体招式，目标会在处于自己攻击范围内的对手中随机选择。\n该招式不会被借助、挥指发动。\n如果最后成功使用的招式为极巨招式，使用其对应的原招式。\n场上宝可梦最后成功使用的招式为以下招式时，仿效使用失败：\n\n调用其他招式的招式，包括仿效本身、梦话、挥指、鹦鹉学舌、自然之力、借助、抢先一步；\n模仿、写生、抢夺、变身；\n强制对面替换的招式，包括吹飞、吼叫、龙尾、巴投；\n真气拳、鸟嘴加农炮、陷阱甲壳；\n守住、看穿、掀榻榻米、王者盾牌、尖刺防守、碉堡、火焰守护；\n看我嘛、愤怒粉；\n镜面反射*、双倍奉还；\n佯攻、帮助；\n同命、挺住；\n戏法、掉包、传递礼物、渴望、小偷；\n打嗝；\n喋喋不休；\n聚光灯；\n庆祝、牵手；\n巨兽弹、巨兽斩、极巨炮；\n晶光星群；\n挣扎；\nＺ招式；\n天星队车使用的专属招式。","levelUpMoves":[{"Name":"Clefairy","Level":0},{"Name":"Jigglypuff","Level":0},{"Name":"Wigglytuff","Level":0},{"Name":"Chansey","Level":0},{"Name":"MrMime","Level":0},{"Name":"MrMime form:galarian","Level":0},{"Name":"Jynx","Level":0},{"Name":"Eevee","Level":30},{"Name":"Vaporeon","Level":0},{"Name":"Jolteon","Level":0},{"Name":"Flareon","Level":0},{"Name":"Cleffa","Level":0},{"Name":"Igglybuff","Level":0},{"Name":"Sudowoodo","Level":0},{"Name":"Espeon","Level":0},{"Name":"Umbreon","Level":0},{"Name":"Smoochum","Level":8},{"Name":"Blissey","Level":0},{"Name":"Skitty","Level":19},{"Name":"Plusle","Level":22},{"Name":"Minun","Level":22},{"Name":"Spinda","Level":5},{"Name":"Bonsly","Level":0},{"Name":"MimeJr","Level":0},{"Name":"Happiny","Level":0},{"Name":"Riolu","Level":48},{"Name":"Lucario","Level":0},{"Name":"Leafeon","Level":0},{"Name":"Glaceon","Level":0},{"Name":"Mesprit","Level":70},{"Name":"Sylveon","Level":0},{"Name":"Mimikyu form:disguised","Level":0},{"Name":"Marshadow","Level":0},{"Name":"Marshadow form:zenith","Level":0},{"Name":"Wooloo","Level":8},{"Name":"Wooloo form:shorn","Level":8},{"Name":"Dubwool","Level":0},{"Name":"Dubwool form:shorn","Level":0},{"Name":"MrRime","Level":0},{"Name":"Tandemaus","Level":41},{"Name":"Maushold form:family_four","Level":46},{"Name":"Maushold form:family_three","Level":46},{"Name":"Squawkabilly form:green","Level":27},{"Name":"Squawkabilly form:blue","Level":27},{"Name":"Squawkabilly form:yellow","Level":27},{"Name":"Squawkabilly form:white","Level":27},{"Name":"Fla